373	     * {@code memberId} (routed through {@link #primaryIdentifier}), the two values a downstream
374	     * consumer needs to address the welcome to the new member.
375	     *
376	     * @param owner the freshly created and persisted owner, already stamped with its {@code memberId}
377	     */
378	    private void enqueueWelcomeNotification(Owner owner) {
