384	     * The owner's primary identifier, as carried on the {@link OwnerCreatedEvent} audit event: the
385	     * unified {@code memberId}. Routing the audit event through this single accessor keeps the audit
386	     * trail's notion of the owner's identity in one place.
387	     *
388	     * @param owner the freshly created owner, already stamped with its {@code memberId}
