436	     * Rejects an owner whose supplied {@code postcode} is invalid for its {@code city}. The postcode is
437	     * optional: when absent (null) the owner is accepted unchanged, so the request contract stays
438	     * backward-compatible. When present it must be four digits and, when the city maps to a known region,
439	     * must fall within that region's fixed inclusive range ({@code NSW 2000-2099}, {@code VIC 3000-3099},
440	     * {@code QLD 4000-4099}); a city with no known region accepts any 4-digit postcode. See
441	     * {@link PostcodeValidator}.
442	     *
443	     * @param ownerFieldsDto the submitted owner fields (its {@code city} is non-blank here,
444	     *                       {@link #rejectBlankOwnerFields} having already run)
